<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  a4kStreaming Debrid window (tvOS-like). The same rules as a4k-home.xml: 1080p pixels = reference app units x2, no
  includes and no named colours, Estuary font names, every control places itself (left/top).

  The header holds the Premiumize account: the pill (days left, or Expired in red), the fair-use meter (701, set from
  Python) and the storage used. Under it the tabs (100: Downloads | Cloud, the current one marked by its on property),
  Clear finished (110, on Downloads while a transfer is finished) and the banner (120: a failed request's Retry, or
  the missing key's Open Settings). Downloads (200) and Cloud (300) are filled and repainted in place from Python
  (a4kStreaming/ui/debrid.py); Python moves Down from the tabs into the current list, and the tabs follow Left/Right.

  A Downloads row: the name, the status chip (a4k.state picks its colour), the progress bar and its % (Label2) and
  Premiumize's message line. The bar is ListItem.PercentPlayed: a progress control reads no item property.
  A Cloud row: the name and its size and date (Label2), Folder for a folder.
  No defaultcontrol: the lists are empty when the window inits; onInit focuses the tabs.
-->
